# repack.py runtime work directory: recreated (rmtree) on every run.
# Contains the bootloader/app1 extracted from the factory firmware and the
# generated all-app-nuttx.bin; not tracked (large, and contains Beken
# proprietary images).
tools/bk_repack_work/

# Common temporaries / build artifacts
*.pyc
__pycache__/
*.o
*.elf
